","205x158":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=205&height=158&smart=true","225x127":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=225&height=127&smart=true","233x303":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=233&height=303&smart=true","254x190":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=254&height=190&smart=true","260x110":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=260&height=110&smart=true","270x175":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=270&height=175&smart=true","270x270":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=270&height=270&smart=true","300x352":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=300&height=352&smart=true","320x180":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=320&height=180&smart=true","350x225":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=350&height=225&smart=true","400x225":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=400&smart=true","400x257":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=400&smart=true","402x156":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=402&height=156&smart=true","402x85":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=402&height=85&smart=true","410x480":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=410&height=480&smart=true","420x545":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=420&height=545&smart=true","500x500":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=500&height=500&smart=true","540x250":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=540&height=250&smart=true","540x300":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=540&height=300&smart=true","600x908":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=600&height=908&smart=true","700x908":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=700&height=908&smart=true","770x190":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=770&height=190&smart=true","770x495":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=770&smart=true","770xorig":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=770&smart=true","800x600":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=800&smart=true","85x125":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=85&height=125&smart=true","90x100":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=90&height=100&smart=true","90x90":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=90&height=90&smart=true","910x590":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&width=910&height=590&smart=true","origx200":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&height=200&smart=true","origxorig":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg?auth=0699e04ce67155842a7a6dfc1e7b0e6cc6180c6348dd6855eda5f784e6cc6b01&&smart=true"},"type":"image","url":"https://cloudfront-us-east-1.images.arcpublishing.com/abccolor/QLOHLWV3TZAUFERFT3VK6GCZEU.jpg"},{"_id":"XVZNNEBBUZDI3COKHGFDWM4AGM","content":"En Paraguay fueron evaluados<b> 6.510 estudiantes</b> de <b>293 instituciones educativas</b>, representando a un total de más de 82.000 alumnos de 15 años que estudian en el país. ","type":"text"},{"_id":"3HNOULG4LJGIHH2PGR5RCYDSFM","content":"En promedio, los resultados de los estudiantes paraguayos en matemática se han mantenido en niveles similares a los de la evaluación PISA anterior, realizada en 2022. Sin embargo, <b>el rendimiento en ciencia y lectura ha bajado</b>. ","type":"text"},{"_id":"JY4D2LAPXRCTJEI46Y3DX4IXVE","content":"Lea más: <a href=\"https://www.abc.com.py/internacionales/2026/09/08/pisa-constata-un-bajon-en-los-resultados-en-lectura-que-se-achaca-a-las-nuevas-tecnologias/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" title=\"https://www.abc.com.py/internacionales/2026/09/08/pisa-constata-un-bajon-en-los-resultados-en-lectura-que-se-achaca-a-las-nuevas-tecnologias/\">PISA constata un bajón en los resultados en lectura que se achaca a las nuevas tecnologías</a>","type":"text"},{"_id":"L4IZ5IK2FBCZZNTZ2I6SQOESCA","content":"La OCDE especula que, en parte, la caída porcentual en rendimiento podría deberse al hecho de que la educación secundaria en el país se ha expandido a poblaciones que antes no tenían acceso a esta, teniendo en cuenta que el número de estudiantes elegibles para el examen PISA en 2025 fue más alto que en 2022 a pesar de que la población de adolescentes de 15 años en el país era más baja. ","type":"text"},{"_id":"XWWVURORJFBL7IVG53TYNXRGRQ","content":"El informe PISA hace énfasis en que varios de los estudiantes evaluados en Paraguay asistían a colegios cuyos directivos decían ver un <b>déficit en el número de docentes o recursos materiales</b>, una situación que también se mantuvo similar a lo registrado en el informe correspondiente a 2022.","type":"text"},{"_id":"I6M4JJ43SVEQNBUU5SU73GJXAA","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Estudiantes de alto rendimiento (Nivel 5 o 6)</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lato:wght@300;400&family=Montserrat:wght@700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  \n  <style>\n    /* ===================================================\n       SISTEMA DE DISEÑO / VARIABLES\n       =================================================== */\n    :root {\n      --primary: #ffe500;\n      --text-main: #000000;\n      --border-color: #e2e8f0;\n      --bg-neutral: #f1f5f9;\n      --bar-secondary: #94a3b8;\n      --radius: 10px; /* Obligatorio: entre 8px y 12px */\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      padding: 24px 16px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n    }\n\n    /* Reglas tipográficas obligatorias */\n    h1, h2, h3, h4 {\n      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n\n    p, span, button, text {\n      font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    /* ===================================================\n       CONTENEDOR Y ESTRUCTURA DE TARJETA\n       =================================================== */\n    .chart-card {\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 640px;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      padding: 24px;\n    }\n\n    .card-header {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .card-title {\n      font-size: 1.15rem;\n      letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    }\n\n    .card-subtitle {\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      color: #475569;\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      line-height: 1.4;\n      font-weight: 300;\n    }\n\n    /* ===================================================\n       BOTONES Y CONTROLES (UTILITARIO Y PLANO)\n       =================================================== */\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    .btn {\n      appearance: none;\n      border: none;\n      box-shadow: none;\n      border-radius: var(--radius);\n      background-color: var(--primary);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n      padding: 8px 14px;\n      font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      font-weight: 400;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: filter 0.15s ease;\n    }\n\n    /* Hover: solo oscurecimiento sutil, sin translate */\n    .btn:hover {\n      filter: brightness(0.92);\n    }\n\n    .btn:active {\n      filter: brightness(0.85);\n    }\n\n    .btn.btn-outline {\n      background-color: var(--bg-neutral);\n      color: var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .btn.active {\n      background-color: var(--primary);\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    /* ===================================================\n       LEYENDA\n       ========================================= */\n    .legend {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 16px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n    }\n\n    .legend-item {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n\n    .legend-box {\n      width: 12px;\n      height: 12px;\n      border-radius: 2px;\n    }\n\n    .box-py {\n      background-color: var(--primary);\n      border: 1px solid var(--text-main);\n    }\n\n    .box-ocde {\n      background-color: var(--bar-secondary);\n    }\n\n    /* ===================================================\n       ÁREA DEL GRÁFICO (SVG)\n       =================================================== */\n    .chart-wrapper {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n\n    svg {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n      overflow: visible;\n    }\n\n    .grid-line {\n      stroke: var(--border-color);\n      stroke-width: 1;\n    }\n\n    .axis-label {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      fill: #64748b;\n      font-weight: 300;\n    }\n\n    .category-label {\n      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      fill: var(--text-main);\n      text-anchor: middle;\n    }\n\n    /* Barras */\n    .bar {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: filter 0.15s ease;\n    }\n\n    .bar-py {\n      fill: var(--primary);\n      stroke: var(--text-main);\n      stroke-width: 1;\n    }\n\n    .bar-ocde {\n      fill: var(--bar-secondary);\n    }\n\n    .bar:hover {\n      filter: brightness(0.88);\n    }\n\n    /* Tooltip utilitario flotante */\n    .tooltip {\n      position: absolute;\n      display: none;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      background-color: var(--text-main);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      font-size: 0.75rem;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      transform: translate(-50%, -120%);\n      z-index: 20;\n    }\n\n    .tooltip strong {\n      font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n      color: var(--primary);\n    }\n\n    /* ===================================================\n       PIE DE GRÁFICO (NOTA TÉCNICA)\n       =================================================== */\n    .card-footer {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      padding-top: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .footer-note {\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\n      color: #64748b;\n      line-height: 1.45;\n      font-weight: 300;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 480px) {\n      .chart-card {\n        padding: 16px;\n      }\n      .card-title {\n        font-size: 1.05rem;\n      }\n      .category-label {\n        font-size: 11px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"chart-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-header\">\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\">Estudiantes de alto rendimiento (Nivel 5 o 6)</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-subtitle\">Los que resuelven problemas complejos y aplican conocimiento a situaciones no familiares</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Filtros de interacción directa -->\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button class=\"btn active\" onclick=\"filterSeries('all', this)\">Todas las áreas</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"filterSeries('Ciencias', this)\">Ciencias</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"filterSeries('Matemática', this)\">Matemática</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" onclick=\"filterSeries('Lectura', this)\">Lectura</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Leyenda plana -->\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <div class=\"legend-item\">\n        <span class=\"legend-box box-py\"></span>\n        <span>Paraguay</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\">\n        <span class=\"legend-box box-ocde\"></span>\n        <span>Promedio OCDE</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Gráfico SVG Interactivo -->\n    <div class=\"chart-wrapper\">\n      <div id=\"chart-tooltip\" class=\"tooltip\"></div>\n      <svg id=\"chart-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 260\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\"></svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card-footer\">\n      <p class=\"footer-note\">En matemática y lectura, la nota aclara que \"casi ningún estudiante\" paraguayo alcanzó este nivel; en ciencias, la proporción también es marginal.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    const dataset = [\n      { area: \"Ciencias\", py: 1.0, ocde: 7.0, notePy: \"Proporción marginal (~1%)\" },\n      { area: \"Matemática\", py: 1.0, ocde: 8.0, notePy: \"Casi ningún estudiante (<1%)\" },\n      { area: \"Lectura\", py: 1.0, ocde: 6.0, notePy: \"Casi ningún estudiante (<1%)\" }\n    ];\n\n    const svg = document.getElementById('chart-svg');\n    const tooltip = document.getElementById('chart-tooltip');\n\n    const chartHeight = 200;\n    const chartWidth = 460;\n    const originX = 35;\n    const originY = 15;\n    const maxVal = 10; // Eje 0% a 10%\n\n    function render(data) {\n      svg.innerHTML = '';\n\n      // Ejes y líneas horizontales de 0% a 10% (pasos de 1%)\n      for (let i = 0; i <= maxVal; i++) {\n        const y = originY + chartHeight - (chartHeight * (i / maxVal));\n\n        const line = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"line\");\n        line.setAttribute(\"x1\", originX);\n        line.setAttribute(\"y1\", y);\n        line.setAttribute(\"x2\", originX + chartWidth);\n        line.setAttribute(\"y2\", y);\n        line.setAttribute(\"class\", \"grid-line\");\n        svg.appendChild(line);\n\n        const label = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"text\");\n        label.setAttribute(\"x\", originX - 6);\n        label.setAttribute(\"y\", y + 3);\n        label.setAttribute(\"text-anchor\", \"end\");\n        label.setAttribute(\"class\", \"axis-label\");\n        label.textContent = i + \"%\";\n        svg.appendChild(label);\n      }\n\n      // Distribución de barras\n      const slotWidth = chartWidth / data.length;\n      const barWidth = Math.min(34, slotWidth * 0.22);\n      const gap = 6;\n\n      data.forEach((d, idx) => {\n        const centerX = originX + (slotWidth * idx) + (slotWidth / 2);\n\n        // Barra Paraguay\n        const pyH = (chartHeight * (d.py / maxVal));\n        const pyY = originY + chartHeight - pyH;\n        const pyX = centerX - barWidth - (gap / 2);\n\n        const rectPy = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"rect\");\n        rectPy.setAttribute(\"x\", pyX);\n        rectPy.setAttribute(\"y\", pyY);\n        rectPy.setAttribute(\"width\", barWidth);\n        rectPy.setAttribute(\"height\", pyH);\n        rectPy.setAttribute(\"rx\", \"2\");\n        rectPy.setAttribute(\"class\", \"bar bar-py\");\n        bindHover(rectPy, `<strong>Paraguay:</strong> ${d.notePy}`);\n        svg.appendChild(rectPy);\n\n        // Barra OCDE\n        const ocdeH = (chartHeight * (d.ocde / maxVal));\n        const ocdeY = originY + chartHeight - ocdeH;\n        const ocdeX = centerX + (gap / 2);\n\n        const rectOcde = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"rect\");\n        rectOcde.setAttribute(\"x\", ocdeX);\n        rectOcde.setAttribute(\"y\", ocdeY);\n        rectOcde.setAttribute(\"width\", barWidth);\n        rectOcde.setAttribute(\"height\", ocdeH);\n        rectOcde.setAttribute(\"rx\", \"2\");\n        rectOcde.setAttribute(\"class\", \"bar bar-ocde\");\n        bindHover(rectOcde, `<strong>Promedio OCDE:</strong> ${d.ocde}% en ${d.area}`);\n        svg.appendChild(rectOcde);\n\n        // Etiqueta Eje X\n        const labelArea = document.createElementNS(\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\", \"text\");\n        labelArea.setAttribute(\"x\", centerX);\n        labelArea.setAttribute(\"y\", originY + chartHeight + 20);\n        labelArea.setAttribute(\"class\", \"category-label\");\n        labelArea.textContent = d.area;\n        svg.appendChild(labelArea);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function bindHover(element, content) {\n      element.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => {\n        tooltip.innerHTML = content;\n        tooltip.style.display = 'block';\n      });\n\n      element.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n        const bounds = svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n        tooltip.style.left = (e.clientX - bounds.left) + 'px';\n        tooltip.style.top = (e.clientY - bounds.top) + 'px';\n      });\n\n      element.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n        tooltip.style.display = 'none';\n      });\n    }\n\n    function filterSeries(area, button) {\n      document.querySelectorAll('.controls .btn').forEach(btn => {\n        btn.classList.remove('active');\n        btn.classList.add('btn-outline');\n      });\n\n      button.classList.add('active');\n      button.classList.remove('btn-outline');\n\n      if (area === 'all') {\n        render(dataset);\n      } else {\n        render(dataset.filter(item => item.area === area));\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Inicializar\n    render(dataset);\n  <\/script>\n</body>\n</html>","type":"raw_html"},{"_id":"DNLWMU6RPFFUTBWRGQVAQZKXNQ","content":"Uso de pantallas e inteligencia artificial","level":2,"type":"header"},{"_id":"NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE","caption":"El uso ocioso de dispositivos electrónicos con pantalla como teléfonos celulares o tabletas en el entorno escolar podría incidir en las bajas calificaciones.","credits":{"by":[{"byline":"monkeybusinessimages","name":"monkeybusinessimages","type":"author"}]},"resized_urls":{"1080x1270":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=1080&height=1270&smart=true","110x70":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=110&height=70&smart=true","1140x663":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=1140&height=663&smart=true","115x115":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=115&height=115&smart=true","1200x1080":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=1200&smart=true","1280x720":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=1280&height=720&smart=true","1300x900":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=1300&height=900&smart=true","140x191":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=140&height=191&smart=true","155x87":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJBD55W46UWE.jpg?auth=847dfeb9b8a190062359ac4cd811884fe86316994d68ba0aa2793dd997b774a4&width=155&smart=true","170x110":"https://www.abc.com.py/resizer/v2/NHSMC2P6P5HTHDOJ